WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:07.158
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:07.159 --> 00:00:10.532
What do they see?

3
00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:18.784
They see the North Pole.

4
00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:48.224
Oh, look! There's Santa's workshop.

5
00:00:48.225 --> 00:01:07.916
The blobs run inside.

6
00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:25.681
They help make toys.

7
00:01:25.682 --> 00:01:44.519
They help wrap boxes.

8
00:01:44.520 --> 00:02:07.753
They help move presents.

9
00:02:07.754 --> 00:02:17.050
They help load Santa's sleigh.

10
00:02:17.051 --> 00:02:32.767
They help feed the reindeer.

11
00:02:32.768 --> 00:02:43.297
They get in Santa's sleigh.

12
00:02:43.298 --> 00:02:50.011
Blobs, what are you doing?

13
00:02:50.012 --> 00:02:56.390
Uh-oh! The sleigh takes off.

14
00:02:56.391 --> 00:03:01.709
Silly blobs!

15
00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:06.938
Good-bye—and Merry Christmas!

